{title: Ek Din Teri Raahon Mein}
{artist: Javed Ali Pritam Naqaab}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] Ek din, Ek din teri raahon me,        [A#] Baahon me, panahon me
[C] Aaonga kho jaaon [A] ga,        Ek [A#] din tera [C] ho jaaon [Dm] ga
[Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,        keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein
[Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka,        [Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,
keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein,        [Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka
[F] Tu, jaane na [Am] tu,        Chahat [A#] meri kitni [C] betaab [F] hai
Ho [F] jo barso [Am] meri,        Palkon mein [A#] tha tu [C] wohi khwaab [F] hai
[Dm] Har ghadi har ghadi teri yaadoon me,        [A#] Bhaadon mein iraadon mein
[C] Aaonga kho jaaon [A] ga,        Ek [A#] din tera [C] ho jaaon [Dm] ga
[Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,        keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein
[Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka,        [Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,
keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein,        [Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka
[F] Yeh Jhukti na [Am] zar,        Jaane [A#] jigar hosh [C] le jaati [F] hai
[F] Mein kaise ka [Am] hoon,        Ek [A#] ajnabi dard [C] de jaati [F] hai
[Dm] Chupke se, Chupke se teri neendo me,        [A#] Khwaabon me khayalon mein
[C] Chaaunga Kho jaaun [A] ga,        Ek [A#] din tera [C] ho jaaon [Dm] ga
[Dm] Ek din, Ek din teri raahon me,        [A#] Baahon me, panahon me
[C] Aaonga kho jaaon [A] ga,        Ek [A#] din tera [C] ho jaaon [Dm] ga
[Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,        keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein
[Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka,        [Dm] Yeh dil to [C] na,
keh [A#] saka yeh [F] baatein,        [Dm] Dil to [C] na keh [Dm] saka
